OL,3,AMinister condemns disorder at
OL,4,APortsmouth anti-migrant protest after
OL,5,Apolice officers hurt
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe protests followed a large group of
OL,8,Fmasked men holding a demonstration over
OL,9,Fsmall-boat crossings at the Port of
OL,10,FDover on Saturday, causing major
OL,11,Fdisruption.
OL,13,FPortsmouth City Council said the Home
OL,14,FOffice had "serious questions to
OL,15,Fanswer" over the decision to bring the
OL,16,Fmigrants, who had crossed the English
OL,17,FChannel from France, to shore in the
OL,18,Farea.
